    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma, Daliyo omukama nubwo yaragiire, baaserre omunsi Bbabbulooni, omunju enyakurumu amaahurro ebihandiiko nambere byayahurwaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi baaserra omurubuga orukuru Akimesa, orunyakuli omu kicweka ky'ensi ekya Mediya, baasangaho omuzingo gw'empapura ogukaba guhandiikirweho: “Ekyokwijukya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omumwaka ogw'okubanza ogw'engoma y'omukama Sirasi, omukama ogu akaturukya ekiragiro ekirukukwata ha nju ya Ruhanga naagamba ati: “Enju egi eyombekwe buhyaaka, ebe kiikaro ekiraatambirwamuga ebyonzira, kandi ekiraaleetwamuga ebihongwa eby'okwokya; obwemi bwayo sentimita enkumi ibiri mu rukaaga nkaaga na itaano, obugazi bwayo, nazo sentimita enkumi ibiri murukaaga nkaaga na itaano, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omukoba gw'ebisiika enkarra isatu ez'amabaale n'orukarra rumu orw'embaaho; sente ez'okusasura, iruge omu lyahurro erya sente z'obukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebikwato eby'enju ya Ruhanga, ebya zaabbu n'eby'efeeza, Nebbukadeneeza ebi yaihire omunju ya Ruhanga eya Yerusaalemu yabireeta Bbabbulooni, bigarurweyo kandi biretwe omunju ya MUKAMA eya Yerusaalemu, buli kintu bakigarre omu kiikaro kyakyo; obite omunju ya Ruhanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Habweki, Tatenayi omulemi w'ekicweka ky'ensi eky'obuseeri bw'ekisaaru Sesarabbozenayi, n'abalemi abakuru bagenzi banyu abanyakuli omukicweka ky'ensi obuseeri bw'ekisaaru, mubeesungusule; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omulimo ogw'enju ya Ruhanga enu mugurugeho: Muleke omulemi w'Abaayudaya, n'abakuru baabo, nubo bombeke buhyaaka enju ya Ruhanga enu omukibanja kyayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekindi, nintaho ekiragiro ekirukukwataho eki muraakorra abakuru b'Abaayudaya ha kwombeka buhyaka enju ya Ruhanga; abasaija banu, basasurwe bwango sente zaabo zoona, hataroho kusiibyaho, ziruge ha sente ezinyakutaaha omunsaho y'obukama, nugwo omusoro ogunyakuruga omu kicweka ky'ensi eky'obuseeri bw'ekisaaru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyona ekirukwetaagwa, nk'enimi ento, entaama, entaama empaya, rundi ebuguma kuba kihongwa eby'okwokya ebya Ruhanga ow'iguru, engano, ekisura, eviini rundi amagita, banyakatagara aba Yerusaalemu ebi baraabaga nibeetaaga, ebi bibaheebwege buli kiro hatali kusaraho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nukwo batambirege Ruhanga ow'iguru ebyonzira ebi asiima, kandi basabire omukama n'abaana be. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninyongera kutaho ekiragiro ekindi: Obu halibaho omuntu ahindura ekiragiro kinu, omurabba gulisomorwa ha nju ye, omuntu ogu aguhanikweho, enju ye eriforwa nk'etuumo y'obusa bw'ente. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruhanga ayakomere okuramizibwaga omu kiikaro eki naakabuuleeze omukama weena, rundi abantu boona abaligorra omukono kuhindura rundi kuseesa enju ya Yerusaalemu. Nyowe Daliyo, nataho ekiragiro; ekiragiro eki ky'okukwatirwa kimu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
