              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.12.1+EXO.12.2+EXO.12.3+EXO.12.4+EXO.12.5+EXO.12.6+EXO.12.7+EXO.12.8+EXO.12.9+EXO.12.10+EXO.12.11+EXO.12.12+EXO.12.13+EXO.12.14+EXO.12.15+EXO.12.16+EXO.12.17+EXO.12.18+EXO.12.19+EXO.12.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kurug 12:1-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakiro ekya ikumi na bbina eky'okwezi okw'okubanza, enzaahi abaagarwirwe bakasemeza ekiro kikuru eky'okwijuka obugenyi obw'okuhingurwaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba banyakatagara n'Abaleevi bakaba beeyeriize hamu; boona bakaba batarukuzira. Nukwo kwitira enzaahi boona, akataama ak'okwijuka obugenyi obw'okuhingurwaho, habwa banyakatagara bagenzi baabo, na habwabo bonka; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akataama ako kakaliibwa abantu ba Isirairi abakaba bazaahukire, na boona abakaba beeteeraniize nabo beeyiihireho obubi obw'abantu ab'ensi egi, baaramya Ruhanga owa Isirairi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakamara ebiro musanju, nibasemeza n'omuhinbo ekiro kikuru eky'okwijuka obugenyi obw'emigaati etatumbisiibwe; habwokuba MUKAMA nuwe abahaire omuhimbo ogu, kandi ataahizeemu omukama w'Asiriya omutima ogw'okubagirra embabazi, nukwo kubongera ha mulimo ogw'enju ya Ruhanga, Ruhanga owa Isirairi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
